{"3828740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Chicken Jump, Puppy Jump", "steam_appid": 3828740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Join Our Community</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📢Ready to squad up? </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pop into our <strong>Discord</strong> server, and find more teammates! Link on the right👉</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >YouTube: @ChickenJumpPuppyJump</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828740/extras/3eb2c19092fdb10cdeede01f7a5275af.avif?t=1786418488\" width=1000 height=234 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a dark, stormy night, a secret band of adorable animal thieves sneaks into the museum, setting their sights on the legendary super-treasure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >…Wait — <strong>There’s more than one team?!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who will laugh last and claim the top spot on the Bounty Board?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828740/extras/c6b347befa46ed87676e383591f7d51b.avif?t=1786418488\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Chicken Jump, Puppy Jump</strong></i><strong> </strong>is a multiplayer party game mixing treasure hunts and head-to-head mayhem, for 4–8 players online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as an animal thief, infiltrate scenes, snatch resources, and haul treasures back to your team’s vault.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The team with the highest score wins it all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828740/extras/ae5b85c542ed20d5cef3897c065fa521.poster.avif?t=1786418488\" width=1138 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828740/extras/ae5b85c542ed20d5cef3897c065fa521.webm?t=1786418488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🧠 Steal or Snatch — Anything Goes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first half of the match runs in <strong>Peace Mode</strong>: carry treasures or toss items to disrupt rivals — there are countless strategies, and every round feels fresh and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828740/extras/d866eca47cc6bb4cc3ac2144703ccb21.poster.avif?t=1786418488\" width=752 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828740/extras/d866eca47cc6bb4cc3ac2144703ccb21.webm?t=1786418488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828740/extras/d866eca47cc6bb4cc3ac2144703ccb21.mp4?t=1786418488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎰 Slot Machine &amp; Super Treasures</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For every 5 high-value items you haul, you trigger a <strong>slot machine</strong> at your base to win powerful tools.<br>Occasionally, <strong>Super Treasures</strong> drop across the map — a comeback may be right around the corner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828740/extras/724e1d9654eb4ee4c7bf0d864185c160.poster.avif?t=1786418488\" width=1138 height=514 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828740/extras/724e1d9654eb4ee4c7bf0d864185c160.webm?t=1786418488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🤝 Team Synergy &amp; Buffs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Divide roles smartly, cover each other, and safely return loot to your vault.<br>Even if you’re captured and sent to <strong>Jail</strong>, you can turn the tables — complete special tasks to grant buffs to your whole team!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828740/extras/51e1304496668972828cb671a1200742.poster.avif?t=1786418488\" width=1138 height=532 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828740/extras/51e1304496668972828cb671a1200742.webm?t=1786418488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🔫 Full-On Brawl Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the second half begins, all bets are off!<br>Every player gets a punching pistol. Ambush rivals, sabotage teammates, fight over treasure — chaotic fun guaranteed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828740/extras/cda75196c8662911df14c203d8a9000d.poster.avif?t=1786418488\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828740/extras/cda75196c8662911df14c203d8a9000d.webm?t=1786418488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828740/extras/cda75196c8662911df14c203d8a9000d.mp4?t=1786418488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎉 Party, Social, Chaos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squad up with longtime friends or new allies, sabotage each other, break the ice, and laugh until it hurts.<br>Every match is a comedy of blunders and betrayals — the ultimate “friendly feud” party experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828740/extras/c9a76e5e032699b55bdb91cf62358adc.poster.avif?t=1786418488\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828740/extras/c9a76e5e032699b55bdb91cf62358adc.webm?t=1786418488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828740/extras/c9a76e5e032699b55bdb91cf62358adc.mp4?t=1786418488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come and join the party with your buddies — the chaos is waiting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a dark, stormy night, a secret band of adorable animal thieves sneaks into the museum, setting their sights on the legendary super-treasure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >…Wait — <strong>There’s more than one team?!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who will laugh last and claim the top spot on the Bounty Board?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828740/extras/c6b347befa46ed87676e383591f7d51b.avif?t=1786418488\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Chicken Jump, Puppy Jump</strong></i><strong> </strong>is a multiplayer party game mixing treasure hunts and head-to-head mayhem, for 4–8 players online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as an animal thief, infiltrate scenes, snatch 